OL,3,GNEWSAChild ketamine users getting
OL,4,Abladder damage describe 'peeing a
OL,5,Ajellyfish'
OL,6,
OL,7,FChildren as young as 13 are getting
OL,8,Fketamine bladder damage, doctors
OL,9,Frunning the UK's first and only
OL,10,Fdedicated NHS clinic for it have told
OL,11,Fthe BBC in an exclusive interview.
OL,13,FMedics at Alder Hey Hospital in
OL,14,FLiverpool say some patients - they have
OL,15,Fhad over 100 referrals since opening
OL,16,Flast May - describe "peeing a
OL,17,Fjellyfish", which is some of the
OL,18,Fbladder's protective lining being shed.
OL,20,FProlonged damage can lead to
OL,21,Fincontinence or uncontrolled peeing,
OL,22,Fand even kidney failure.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
